        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST**\n\n*** LUXURY 4 BED / 4 BATH PROPERTY *** PRIVATE GYM *** SUPERB LOCATION *** FULLY FURNISHED *** GATED SECURE PARKING *** AVAILABLE NOW ***\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to bring this spectacular property to the rental market situated in Delgany, Co Wicklow. Nestled in a secluded and peaceful country setting, this exceptional 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom detached residence offers luxury living in one of Wicklow's most desirable locations. Finished and furnished to an outstanding standard throughout, this high-end home combines contemporary elegance with unique character features, creating a truly impressive rental opportunity.\nThe property boasts expansive living accommodation with massive light-filled bedrooms, including two luxurious ensuite bedrooms and a stunning walk-in wardrobe. Every room has been carefully designed with premium furnishings, bespoke finishes, and amazing feature lighting that enhances the home's sophisticated atmosphere.\nA standout feature of the property is the beautiful original stone walls, blending timeless charm with modern architectural design. The spacious interiors are complemented by a fully equipped private gym, ideal for modern living.\nExternally, the home is accessed through secure electric gates and offers ample private parking. Surrounded by mature greenery and countryside, the property enjoys complete privacy and tranquillity while remaining within easy reach of Delgany, Greystones, and commuter routes to Dublin. This is a rare opportunity to rent a truly unique luxury home offering space, privacy, and premium finishes in a beautiful Wicklow setting. AVAILABLE NOW, and viewing highly advised.\n\nKey Features:\nExceptional 4-bedroom / 4-bathroom detached home\nTwo large ensuite bedrooms\nWalk-in wardrobe\nFurnished to an extremely high standard\nOriginal stone wall features\nStunning designer lighting throughout\nPrivate gym\nSecure gated entrance\nAmple parking\nQuiet and secluded country setting\nSpacious, light-filled interiors\nClose to Delgany & Greystones amenities\n\n** RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE - FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE **\n"
